    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a740e3ac-80d5-5513-9bd0-d1bdaad29a6e" activityNameId="f9a05718-d408-5748-93c3-05edc78f3e9f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gold, from combined metal production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gold, from combined metal production, at refinery
The multi-output process "refining, copper-zinc-lead-gold-silver in smelter" delivers the five co-products "copper/zinc/lead/gold/silver from combined metal production, at refinery". This data set describes the raffination of gold and silver in a Swedish smelter. Allocation is based on economic value.;
UUID: ca6493a2-a161-3cf0-b7f2-be35892aef84
This data set includes the extraction of metals and by products from concentrates and recycled raw materials. It includes energy and water consumption, concentrate inputs, transports, waste disposal, infrastructure use as well as emissions into air and water.
Location: Energy use and emissions are from Swedish mines.
Technology: modern swedish refinement plant
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: &gt;2.36E+5 t of metals
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ca6493a2-a161-3cf0-b7f2-be35892aef84.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
